     zzeeddiitt keys:

                ^BB, ^FF, ^PP, ^NN  move by character and line
                ^AA, ^EE          start / end of line
                ^ZZ, ^VV          page up / down
                BBSS              delete left, joining lines
                DDEELL, ^DD         delete right, joining lines
                RREETTUURRNN          split the line
                TTAABB             insert a literal tab

     A middle click pastes the PRIMARY selection: into a header
