DDIIAAGGNNOOSSTTIICCSS
     All diagnostics appear in dialogs, among them: `No such
     user: ...', `The message is empty', `No recipient in the To:
     field', `Cannot rewrite the mailbox'.

NNOOTTEESS
     The list holds at most 200 messages and the text pane at
     most 500 lines of at most 240 characters; longer messages
     end with `[message truncated]'.  The mailbox is not polled
     while composing.  Quitting from the window menu asks for
     confirmation, but an unfinished composition is still lost.
